    <item>
      <title>2026 Club Cup Shogi Team Tournament Report</title>
      <link>https://ivorypawn.github.io/blog/2026-09-13/en/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 18:19:59 +0900</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ivorypawn.github.io/blog/2026-09-13/en/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;（日本語版：&lt;a href=&#34;../jp/&#34;&gt;2026 クラブカップ将棋対抗戦記&lt;/a&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I played in the Club Cup in Kobe for the first time in well over a decade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tournament-format&#34;&gt;Tournament Format&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3-player team competition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After two preliminary games, teams are placed into one of four knockout brackets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 wins / win then loss / loss then win / 2 losses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;so guaranteed at least 3 games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;30 minutes per player, sudden death&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>2026 クラブカップ将棋対抗戦記</title>
      <link>https://ivorypawn.github.io/blog/2026-09-13/jp/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 12:50:15 +0900</pubDate>
